      48.02,
      470.39,
      286.84,
      573.69
    ],
    "text": "Reference No.: Kadu/Land/03/194/MOD. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
