      302.47,
      460.04,
      541.93,
      608.75
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Kaduwela on the 14th day of October, 2024 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 07th day of October, 2024 the nature of their interests in the land/servitude, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. All deeds and other documents in support of the claims should be produced at the inquiry.",
